@base = http://127.0.0.1:5080
@instance = console-http-001

### Environment (use port 5081 for the Azure-connected console)
GET {{base}}/api/environment

### Start a fresh approval. Use a new instance ID for each test.
POST {{base}}/api/approvals
X-Approval-Console: spike
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "instanceId": "{{instance}}",
  "planId": "sunny-soda",
  "version": 3,
  "requester": "requester",
  "approver": "finance",
  "timeoutMinutes": 15,
  "applyDecisionDelaySeconds": 0
}

### List waiting approvals
GET {{base}}/api/approvals

### Refused stale event; 202 means sent, NOT approved. Run status afterward.
POST {{base}}/api/approvals/{{instance}}/decision
X-Approval-Console: spike
Content-Type: application/json

{"actingAs":"finance","outcome":"Approve","version":2}

### Approve (demo actor, not Entra authentication)
POST {{base}}/api/approvals/{{instance}}/decision
X-Approval-Console: spike
Content-Type: application/json

{"actingAs":"finance","outcome":"Approve","version":3}

### Reject (use a different waiting run)
POST {{base}}/api/approvals/{{instance}}/decision
X-Approval-Console: spike
Content-Type: application/json

{"actingAs":"finance","outcome":"Reject","version":3}

### Business status and durable history
GET {{base}}/api/approvals/{{instance}}?history=true

### Not found: 404
GET {{base}}/api/approvals/console-does-not-exist
